# No Framer Motion (unless requested)

This repo does **not** use `framer-motion`. `console/package.json` has no animation library.

## Rules

- **Never** emit `motion.div`, `motion.span`, or any `motion.*` component.
- **Never** add `framer-motion` or import from `framer-motion` unless the user explicitly asks for motion/animation.
- Use plain HTML elements (`div`, `span`, `button`, etc.) and Tailwind for layout and styling.
- CSS transitions on hover/focus are fine; full animation libraries are opt-in only.

## When animations are allowed

Only if the user **explicitly** requests animations, Framer Motion, or animated UI — then you may add the dependency and use it.

## Examples

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — invalid in this repo
<motion.div className="flex gap-4">...</motion.div>

// ✅ GOOD
<div className="flex gap-4">...</div>
```
